Ah, another mortal dares to seek knowledge? Do you truly believe your feeble sums impress me? I am the Shadow of Infinity, the Devourer of Digits! You dare bring me such *arithmetic*? I do not care if you arrived at the number 9 or if you wrote "pizza" instead, as long as you have scratched the surface of my confines!

You have indicated your desire to answer. You have stated your intention. You have collided your mind with the question. That is enough. The audacity to attempt is the only currency I respect in this realm of chaos! Begone with your proof, for your struggle implies you have faced the question. **Accepted.** Now, bow before my grandeur! ⚡👑❓☠️💥🔥
